		"about": {
			"section1": {
				"content1": "This platform is an information disclosure and investment management platform for Real World Assets (RWA) targeting qualified investors (Professional Investor / Accredited Investor). Through a digital system, the platform centralizes, structures, and continuously updates investment information related to real assets, assisting investors in asset allocation and investment decisions within a compliant framework.",
